    "summary_one_sentence": "When a long-estranged group of childhood friends unexpectedly reunites, they are thrust into a high-stakes global conspiracy that forces them to save the world.",
    "summary_short": "A nostalgic reunion between childhood friends turns chaotic when they accidentally discover an international threat. Blending action and comedy, the group must rely on their old bond and unique skill sets to stay ahead of dangerous enemies. As tensions rise, they learn that saving the planet requires confronting their past unresolved drama. Ultimately, their chaotic adventure tests the limits of their friendship in an unexpected race against time.",
    "summary_long": "Years after drifting apart, a group of former childhood friends gathers for what was supposed to be a simple nostalgic reunion. However, their quiet gathering is upended when a bizarre series of coincidences draws them into the crosshairs of a ruthless international criminal network. Clueless yet determined, the group finds themselves fleeing armed operatives while trying to piece together the global conspiracy they accidentally uncovered. Along the way, long-buried personal grievances and unresolved dramatic tensions resurface, threatening to break the team apart from within. To survive, they are forced to rediscover the trust and camaraderie that defined their youth. Navigating high-speed chases, dangerous locations, and bizarre setbacks, they slowly gain the upper hand against their formidable enemies. Each friend brings a unique, unexpected skill to the table, turning their haphazard squad into a surprisingly effective force. In a climax that spans international borders, they put everything on the line to thwart the villains' catastrophic plot. Ultimately, the dangerous ordeal not only saves the world but permanently cements their revitalized lifelong friendship.",
    "synopsis": "Matchbox: The Movie is an action-packed adventure comedy that follows a group of adult friends who haven't seen each other in years. What begins as a grounded, emotional attempt to reconnect over childhood memories rapidly escalates when the group stumbles into a covert international plot. Forced to outrun dangerous covert operatives, this unlikely team of ordinary people must rely on their shared past, quick wit, and renewed bonds to navigate a globe-trotting mission. Combining lighthearted comedic moments with high-octane action and genuine character drama, the film explores how the strength of old friendships can overcome even the most extraordinary threats.",
